<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-E OCT NET RISES TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-E OCT NET RISES TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.09 vs   0.82</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.09 vs   0.82</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.04 vs   0.20</p>
<p> Sales		    7.69 vs   3.67</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    16.31 vs  13.74</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	16.31 vs  13.74</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.33 vs   4.60 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   53.78 vs  35.08</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish constuction and trading company</p>
<p>is Mostostal Export SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
